Defect: SMI-UNPUBLISHED-MODULE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-unpublished-module

The module imports intSrvFlowStatus FROM INT-SERV-MIB. No publisher ships
a module by that name: RFC 2213 publishes the Integrated Services MIB as
INTEGRATED-SERVICES-MIB, which is what defines intSrvFlowStatus.

The repair is the published spelling.

--- a/CISCO-VISM-TRAPS-MIB
+++ b/CISCO-VISM-TRAPS-MIB
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@
         cwAnnFileName,
         cwAnnFileCodec,
         cwAnnFileStatus              FROM CISCO-WAN-ANNOUNCEMENT-MIB
-        intSrvFlowStatus             FROM INT-SERV-MIB
+        intSrvFlowStatus             FROM INTEGRATED-SERVICES-MIB
         rsvpSessionDestAddr,
         rsvpResvFwdStatus,
         rsvpResvStatus,
